From ec13ac21913ebcc982710032ba1b48027db326a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: liy <liygfg@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 13:25:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: nexell: add S5P6818 x6818 platform support

Squash of the x6818 6.12 port series:

- ARM: nexell: add S5P6818 x6818 platform support
- ARM: nexell: scope cross-cluster SEV lock workaround
- ARM: nexell: fix pinctrl direction readback semantics
- ARM: dts: nexell: fix pinctrl binding docs and gmac-phy-reset node name
- ARM: nexell: use the vendor GPIO-mode ALTFN table for GPIO requests
- ARM: nexell: refcount the shared CLKGEN module gate and tolerate dead PLLs
- ARM: nexell: drop the redundant boot_secondary cache flush
